1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:04,670
StudyFlow connects study costs, funding and student life, with

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:08,730
live AI guidance and simulated financial transactions.

3
00:00:09,407 --> 00:00:12,322
Ask for a school's full-course cost.

4
00:00:12,322 --> 00:00:17,047
The answer combines tuition, living costs and essential expenses.

5
00:00:17,707 --> 00:00:21,842
Open the line items to distinguish sourced fees from estimates.

6
00:00:22,507 --> 00:00:27,962
Compare four universities, with course duration and total cost visible together.

7
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:32,315
Switch the display between baht, yuan and dollars, using

8
00:00:32,315 --> 00:00:34,525
reference exchange rates.

9
00:00:35,207 --> 00:00:38,062
Here is the same comparison in dollars.

10
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:41,925
The assistant reuses the declared savings.

11
00:00:41,925 --> 00:00:46,065
My plan shows the funding gap and a simulated borrowing ceiling.

12
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,955
Edit a fee and save the revised cost estimate.

13
00:00:50,607 --> 00:00:55,042
Inspect the dated cash-flow forecast and the sources behind each fee.

14
00:00:55,707 --> 00:01:00,147
Compare a custom simulated loan with the commercial study-loan example.

15
00:01:00,807 --> 00:01:04,467
This option pays interest during study, followed by principal

16
00:01:04,467 --> 00:01:08,552
and interest. The complete schedule is available.

17
00:01:09,207 --> 00:01:12,337
Here we choose twenty thousand baht over sixty months,

18
00:01:12,337 --> 00:01:15,622
repaying principal and interest from the start.

19
00:01:16,273 --> 00:01:20,718
The student explicitly confirms the plan and simulated application.

20
00:01:21,373 --> 00:01:24,993
The document checklist records demo declarations.

21
00:01:24,993 --> 00:01:28,113
These are not verified document uploads.

22
00:01:28,773 --> 00:01:33,693
Signing requires another confirmation, including the school recipient.

23
00:01:34,373 --> 00:01:37,208
The signed loan schedules payments to the verified school

24
00:01:37,208 --> 00:01:41,268
account. It does not credit the student's wallet.

25
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:45,920
The student requests family support for first-month housing.

26
00:01:46,573 --> 00:01:49,978
A family member confirms through a private link.

27
00:01:49,978 --> 00:01:53,668
A promise alone does not increase the wallet balance.

28
00:01:54,340 --> 00:01:57,625
Only the operator's simulated receipt adds six thousand five

29
00:01:57,625 --> 00:01:59,640
hundred baht to the wallet.

30
00:02:00,307 --> 00:02:04,077
A natural-language request creates a dated reminder.

31
00:02:04,077 --> 00:02:06,872
The student can acknowledge and complete it.

32
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:13,510
Arrival is explicit: the student reports completed registration and confirms enrollment.

33
00:02:14,173 --> 00:02:17,698
Enrollment opens the wallet and daily-life tools.

34
00:02:17,698 --> 00:02:19,903
It does not pay any bill.

35
00:02:20,573 --> 00:02:25,788
Set a six-thousand-baht monthly budget and see upcoming payments and shortfalls.

36
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:28,920
Tell the assistant about lunch.

37
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:31,805
The expense appears in the category totals and reduces

38
00:02:31,805 --> 00:02:33,560
the remaining budget.

39
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:37,405
Undoing the entry restores the remaining budget.

40
00:02:38,073 --> 00:02:41,313
The wallet holds separate currency balances.

41
00:02:41,313 --> 00:02:45,293
Demo top-ups provide the simulated funds shown here.

42
00:02:45,973 --> 00:02:48,888
The live assistant compares conversion quotes and prepares a

43
00:02:48,888 --> 00:02:52,383
proposal. No money moves yet.

44
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:55,925
An incorrect password is refused.

45
00:02:55,925 --> 00:02:58,290
The balance stays unchanged.

46
00:02:58,940 --> 00:03:02,530
After the correct password and confirmation, the server converts

47
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:04,870
five hundred yuan into baht.

48
00:03:05,540 --> 00:03:09,185
For a remittance, the assistant compares routes, fees and

49
00:03:09,185 --> 00:03:13,030
arrival estimates, then requests confirmation.

50
00:03:13,707 --> 00:03:16,697
The confirmed transfer creates a recorded order and debits

51
00:03:16,697 --> 00:03:18,467
the source currency.

52
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:22,905
The Pay tab separates self-funded bills from loan-covered bills,

53
00:03:22,905 --> 00:03:25,670
and shows insufficient wallet funds.

54
00:03:26,340 --> 00:03:30,260
Top up the exact shortfall, then return to payment.

55
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:33,470
Review the tuition payment and enter the password to

56
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:35,680
authorize the wallet debit.

57
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:38,325
The bill becomes paid.

58
00:03:38,325 --> 00:03:41,360
A loan-covered bill cannot be charged again.

59
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:45,110
For the first installment, we advance the demo date

60
00:03:45,110 --> 00:03:47,840
and confirm repayment with a password.

61
00:03:48,507 --> 00:03:51,907
The installment is paid and appears in the loan history.

62
00:03:52,573 --> 00:03:54,938
A smaller bill can use the fixed demo credit

63
00:03:54,938 --> 00:03:58,913
line, creating an amount owed back within thirty days.

64
00:03:59,573 --> 00:04:02,898
Credit repayment now requires a password and actually debits

65
00:04:02,898 --> 00:04:04,743
the simulated wallet.

66
00:04:05,407 --> 00:04:08,317
Repayment restores the available line and adds an on-time

67
00:04:08,317 --> 00:04:10,692
record when paid by the due date.

68
00:04:11,373 --> 00:04:15,368
The server blocks this over-limit transfer without operator approval,

69
00:04:15,368 --> 00:04:17,793
even after a correct password.

70
00:04:18,473 --> 00:04:23,083
The activity log records authorization attempts and confirmed actions.

71
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:27,870
Eligible payments build StudyFlow's internal on-time record.

72
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:30,595
This is not an external credit score.

73
00:04:31,273 --> 00:04:35,303
A separate visitor verifies the signed record without logging in.

74
00:04:35,973 --> 00:04:39,658
Altering the signed statement makes verification fail.

75
00:04:40,340 --> 00:04:43,220
Live AI explains and proposes.

76
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:46,475
The server calculates and enforces limits.

77
00:04:46,475 --> 00:04:49,670
The student authorizes financial actions.
